{"2100410":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Last Trophy","steam_appid":2100410,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/2fa8ee667a53eb2c3eb4666375b6d724.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mell, a space explorer, receives a strange signal from an unknown planet. Interested in the possible rewards, she heads toward the planet. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she approaches to investigate, a strange force field takes control of the ship. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being dragged into the atmosphere, Mell enters the escape module and avoids a direct impact. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, trapped on an unknown planet, Mell needs to find a way to her ship and escape from this place. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/f67a747b65cb917f3c0e2b5227fd5df7.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/8abc1c259673db699e9968983b993f95.avif?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=150 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/70507afefc8cb03f5f36d1a16655b1bc.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/4727a0c9a00759ce9312f6a1d26a5441.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* <\/strong>nostalgic retro art style<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Explore 60 levels among 3 worlds<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Many enemies, obstacles, and challenging gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Discover the plot of this desolate place<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* <\/strong>Defeat the Lords of the Unknown Planet<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1793748775\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras_big\/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1793748775 width=800 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/2fa8ee667a53eb2c3eb4666375b6d724.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mell, a space explorer, receives a strange signal from an unknown planet. Interested in the possible rewards, she heads toward the planet. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she approaches to investigate, a strange force field takes control of the ship. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being dragged into the atmosphere, Mell enters the escape module and avoids a direct impact. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, trapped on an unknown planet, Mell needs to find a way to her ship and escape from this place. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/f67a747b65cb917f3c0e2b5227fd5df7.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/8abc1c259673db699e9968983b993f95.avif?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=150 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/70507afefc8cb03f5f36d1a16655b1bc.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/4727a0c9a00759ce9312f6a1d26a5441.webp?t=1793748775\" width=612 height=40 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* <\/strong>nostalgic retro art style<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Explore 60 levels among 3 worlds<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Many enemies, obstacles, and challenging gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*<\/strong> Discover the plot of this desolate place<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* <\/strong>Defeat the Lords of the Unknown Planet<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras\/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1793748775\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2100410\/extras_big\/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1793748775 width=800 height=80 \/><\/span>